# Hello 👋, I'm Batuhan Baybas
### Frontend Developer

Frontend Engineer with 3+ years of experience building scalable, user-focused web applications with React, Next.js, TypeScript, and modern frontend technologies. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code, improving application performance, and building intuitive user experiences. Currently expanding my expertise into backend development with Node.js, NestJS, PostgreSQL, Prisma, Redis, and real-time technologies. I enjoy building products, exploring new technologies, and turning ideas into production-ready applications.

